<item>
            <title>[NGWD6-49603] [NAE] CF default path (central / dealer) </title>
                <link>https://vwgroup-b2b.atlassian.net/browse/NGWD6-49603</link>
                <project id="10028" key="NGWD6">NGWDESIGN6</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;User Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
As a user, I would like the Dealer Path to be selected by default when creating a CF from the Dealer module, with the Central Path available as an optional selection when needed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Acceptance Criteria:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When creating a CF from the Dealer module, the Dealer Path is preselected by default.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The Central Path is available as an alternative option.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The user can manually switch from Dealer Path to Central Path before submission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Premises / Dependencies:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Describes known dependencies and given premises that might influence the solution. (includes critical timings ~ If unclear when item is raised, please clarify in further refinement sessions latest, before planning.)&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contact / Partners:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
If external Dev.-Partners, other Product-Teams or Stakeholder are needed and known for completing the ticket, please name them here and share contact data, if known.&lt;/p&gt;



